---
/**
 * «Гидравлический пресс» (Irina, 18 Nov 2026: «при изменении силы на рисунке меняется только стрелочка, а сам уровень
 * поршней нет»; «модель сжимания разных тел»). A hand press squeezes a chosen body between the table on the large
 * piston and a fixed upper plate (the plate is lowered onto each new body along the threaded columns and locked).
 *
 * Physics. The hand presses on the small piston (area S₁ = 5…20 см²) with a force F₁; the pressure p = F₁/S₁ is the same
 * everywhere in the oil, so the oil pushes the large piston (S₂ = 50…500 см²) with F₂ = pS₂ = F₁·S₂/S₁. Oil is not
 * compressed: the pistons move only as much as the body gives way. The body is squeezed until its resistance equals F₂;
 * that squeeze x₂ is the rise of the large piston, and the small piston goes down by x₁ = x₂·S₂/S₁ (the same volume of
 * oil). The small cylinder has a stroke of L = 10 см; when x₁ is longer, the press works as real presses do: a valve
 * («клапан») lets the oil from the small cylinder into the large one on the way down and closes on the way up, while
 * the second valve lets the small cylinder fill from the tank. Every stroke is counted. When F₁ is made smaller, the
 * release tap («кран») lets oil from the large cylinder back into the tank until the body's resistance equals the new
 * F₂ (the small piston stays where it is, as in a real press). A new body or a new pair of pistons starts from rest.
 *
 * The bodies (force on the body F, squeeze x):
 *  - Поролон, a block 10 × 10 × 8 см of furniture foam: 3,6 кПа at 40 % squeeze (grade ST 2836, Egida catalogue:
 *    3,6 ± 0,4 кПа), so 36 Н on 100 см². The curve σ(ε) is that of a usual polyurethane foam (Gibson & Ashby,
 *    «Cellular Solids», 1997): a short linear part, a plateau, then the cells close (σ at 65 % ≈ 2,2 × σ at 40 %, the
 *    usual SAG factor 2–3); the table FOAM below; it cannot be squeezed by more than 90 %. Elastic: it springs back.
 *  - Пружина: steel wire d = 4 мм, mean coil diameter D = 40 мм, 6 working coils, free length 100 мм. Stiffness
 *    k = Gd⁴/(8D³n) = 79 ГПа·(4 мм)⁴/(8·(40 мм)³·6) = 6,6 Н/мм. The coils close at 32 мм (8 coils of wire), i.e. after
 *    68 мм, at 448 Н (shear stress then about 820 МПа, below the limit of spring steel); after that the spring is solid
 *    steel and hardly gives. Elastic.
 *  - Грецкий орех, 35 мм tall: the shell gives about 1,5 мм (x ∝ F^(2/3), a Hertz contact) and cracks at about 300 Н
 *    (measured 210–440 Н depending on the variety and the axis: Kermani et al., J. Agric. Machinery 8(1), 2023:
 *    274–441 Н; Int. J. Agric. Biol. Eng. study: 212 Н at 1,68 мм). After the crack the shell falls apart and the
 *    kernel is crushed: x = 14 + 12·(1 − 300 Н/F) мм (a rough model). It does not spring back.
 *  - Пустая банка 0,33 л (115 × 66 мм, aluminium wall 0,1 мм): along its axis it holds about 900 Н (the can makers'
 *    norm is at least 800 Н: Crown/Canit sheet BB-CPS-330, «axial load 800 N min»); until then it gives 0,07 мм
 *    (k = EA/L = 70 ГПа·20,7 мм²/115 мм = 12,6 кН/мм). Above 900 Н the wall buckles and the can folds down to about
 *    20 мм: x = 95 + 5·(1 − 900 Н/F) мм (rough). It does not spring back.
 *  - Брусок of pine 5 × 5 × 5 см standing on its end grain: E = 11,2 ГПа along the grain, crushing strength 42 МПа
 *    (red pine, USDA Wood Handbook 2010, table 5-3a), so k = EA/L = 560 кН/мм; even the largest F₂ = 50 кН squeezes it by
 *    0,09 мм and does not crush it (that needs about 105 кН).
 * Simplified: the plastic bodies spring back along a stiff straight line (20 кН/мм for the can, 10 кН/мм for the nut);
 * the friction of the pistons and the weight of the pistons and the table are left out; the force F₁ is the force on
 * the small piston itself (a real press has a lever).
 *
 * Drawing. To scale, 6 px per сантиметр (0,6 px per мм): the cylinders' widths are their diameters √(4S/π); the
 * bodies, the strokes and the rise of the large piston are true. The tank (600 см² of surface, drawn from the front)
 * shows the oil that went out of it. The arrows of the forces are not to scale: their length grows as the logarithm of
 * the force. Time: the strokes are faster than by hand (0,1…0,7 с each), so that even 100 strokes take about 15 с.
 */
import G7Styles from '../g7/G7Styles.astro';
import KitStyles from '@components/people/PeopleStyles.astro';

const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const F1_STEPS = [0, 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 10, 15, 20, 30, 50, 70, 100, 150, 200, 300, 500];
const F1_START = 2; // index: 2 Н
---

<G7Styles />
<KitStyles />
<figure class="g7 g7--stack prl2 not-content" data-presslab>
	<div class="g7__grid">
		<svg class="g7__svg" viewBox="0 0 360 302" role="img" aria-label="Гидравлический пресс: рука давит на малый поршень, масло поднимает большой поршень со столом, и тело сжимается между столом и верхней плитой" data-svg>
			<defs>
				{['blue', 'red'].map((c) => <marker id={`pr-${uid}-${c}`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="7" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path class={`head--${c}`} d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" /></marker>)}
			</defs>
			<rect class="prl2__frame" x="160" y="238" width="198" height="20" rx="2"></rect>
			<!-- the oil -->
			<path class="prl2__pipe" d="M154 252 V280 H35 V252"></path>
			<rect class="prl2__oil" data-oil-tank></rect>
			<path class="prl2__oil" data-oil></path>
			<path class="prl2__flow" data-flow-in d="M60 248 H104"></path>
			<path class="prl2__flow" data-flow-out></path>
			<path class="prl2__flow" data-flow-back></path>
			<!-- the walls: tank, channel, small cylinder, large cylinder -->
			<path class="prl2__wall" data-wall></path>
			<!-- the valves and the tap -->
			<path class="prl2__seat" d="M68 244 l4 4 l-4 4 Z"></path>
			<path class="prl2__seat" d="M134 244 l4 4 l-4 4 Z"></path>
			<circle class="prl2__ball" data-v1 r="3.6" cy="248"></circle>
			<circle class="prl2__ball" data-v2 r="3.6" cy="248"></circle>
			<g transform="translate(96 280)">
				<circle class="prl2__tap" data-tapc r="6"></circle>
				<line class="prl2__tapbar" data-tap x1="0" y1="-9" x2="0" y2="9"></line>
			</g>
			<text class="t-small" x="35" y="132" text-anchor="middle">бак</text>
			<text class="t-small" x="35" y="144" text-anchor="middle">с маслом</text>
			<text class="t-small" x="104" y="268" text-anchor="middle">клапаны</text>
			<text class="t-small" x="96" y="299" text-anchor="middle">кран</text>
			<!-- the press: base, columns, upper plate -->
			<rect class="prl2__col" x="168" y="20" width="8" height="218"></rect>
			<rect class="prl2__col" x="348" y="20" width="8" height="218"></rect>
			<g data-beam>
				<rect class="prl2__frame" x="160" y="-12" width="200" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__nut" x="165" y="-18" width="14" height="6" rx="1"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__nut" x="345" y="-18" width="14" height="6" rx="1"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__nut" x="165" y="0" width="14" height="6" rx="1"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__nut" x="345" y="0" width="14" height="6" rx="1"></rect>
			</g>
			<!-- the large piston, the ram and the table; the body on the table -->
			<g data-big>
				<rect class="prl2__ram" data-ram y="8" height="94"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__piston" data-p2 y="102" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__table" x="-80" y="0" width="160" height="8" rx="2"></rect>
			</g>
			<g data-body></g>
			<!-- a magnifier (×1,8) above the walnut, which is small at the true scale -->
			<g data-lens>
				<clipPath id={`prl2-lens-${uid}`}><circle cx="262" cy="49" r="34"></circle></clipPath>
				<circle class="prl2__lens" cx="262" cy="49" r="34"></circle>
				<g clip-path={`url(#prl2-lens-${uid})`}><g data-lensbody></g></g>
				<circle class="prl2__lensrim" cx="262" cy="49" r="34"></circle>
				<text class="t-small" x="300" y="78">×1,8</text>
			</g>
			<!-- the small piston, its rod and handle, the hand -->
			<g data-small>
				<rect class="prl2__rod" x="-2.5" y="-72" width="5" height="72"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__piston" data-p1 y="0" height="8" rx="2"></rect>
				<rect class="prl2__handle" x="-24" y="-78" width="48" height="6" rx="3"></rect>
				<!-- the hand (a fist of the shared people kit) presses on the handle from above -->
				<g transform="translate(0 -78)" data-presshand></g>
			</g>
			<text class="t-i prl2__s" data-s1>S<tspan class="prl2__sub" dy="3">1</tspan></text>
			<text class="t-i prl2__s" data-s2 text-anchor="end">S<tspan class="prl2__sub" dy="3">2</tspan></text>
			<!-- the forces -->
			<line class="arrow arrow--blue" data-a1 marker-end={`url(#pr-${uid}-blue)`}></line>
			<line class="arrow arrow--red" data-a2 marker-end={`url(#pr-${uid}-red)`}></line>
			<text class="t-i t-blue t-halo" data-l1 text-anchor="end">F<tspan class="prl2__sub" dy="3">1</tspan></text>
			<text class="t-i t-red t-halo" data-l2>F<tspan class="prl2__sub" dy="3">2</tspan></text>
			<text class="t-strong t-num prl2__count" x="142" y="30" text-anchor="middle" data-count></text>
			<text class="t-small" x="142" y="43" text-anchor="middle" data-count-w></text>
		</svg>
		<div class="g7__side prl2__ctl">
			<div class="prl2__pickcol">
			<div class="g7__seg" role="group" aria-label="Что сжимаем" data-pick>
				<button type="button" class="g7__btn" aria-pressed="true" data-b="foam">Поролон</button>
				<button type="button" class="g7__btn" aria-pressed="false" data-b="spring">Пружина</button>
				<button type="button" class="g7__btn" aria-pressed="false" data-b="nut">Орех</button>
				<button type="button" class="g7__btn" aria-pressed="false" data-b="can">Банка</button>
				<button type="button" class="g7__btn" aria-pressed="false" data-b="wood">Брусок</button>
			</div>
			<button type="button" class="g7__btn g7__again" data-new>Новое тело</button>
			</div>
			<div class="prl2__sliders">
			<label class="g7__slider">
				<span>Сила на малый поршень <i>F</i><sub>1</sub></span>
				<output data-of></output>
				<input type="range" min="0" max={F1_STEPS.length - 1} step="1" value={F1_START} data-f data-steps={F1_STEPS.join(',')} aria-label="Сила на малый поршень, ньютоны" />
			</label>
			<label class="g7__slider">
				<span>Площадь малого поршня <i>S</i><sub>1</sub></span>
				<output data-o1></output>
				<input type="range" min="5" max="20" step="5" value="10" data-s1in aria-label="Площадь малого поршня, квадратные сантиметры" />
			</label>
			<label class="g7__slider">
				<span>Площадь большого поршня <i>S</i><sub>2</sub></span>
				<output data-o2></output>
				<input type="range" min="50" max="500" step="50" value="200" data-s2in aria-label="Площадь большого поршня, квадратные сантиметры" />
			</label>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="prl2__below">
		<ul class="g7__read" aria-live="polite">
			<li><span>Давление в масле <i>p</i> = <i>F</i><sub>1</sub>/<i>S</i><sub>1</sub></span><b data-p></b></li>
			<li class="is-key"><span>Сила на большом поршне <i>F</i><sub>2</sub> = <i>pS</i><sub>2</sub></span><b data-f2></b></li>
			<li><span><i>F</i><sub>2</sub>/<i>F</i><sub>1</sub> = <i>S</i><sub>2</sub>/<i>S</i><sub>1</sub></span><b data-gain></b></li>
		</ul>
		<ul class="g7__read">
			<li><span>Большой поршень поднялся на <i>x</i><sub>2</sub></span><b data-x2></b></li>
			<li><span>Путь малого поршня <i>x</i><sub>1</sub> = <i>x</i><sub>2</sub><i>S</i><sub>2</sub>/<i>S</i><sub>1</sub></span><b data-x1></b></li>
			<li><span>Сделано ходов (по 10&nbsp;см)</span><b data-n></b></li>
		</ul>
		<p class="g7__msg prl2__msg" data-msg></p>
	</div>
	<figcaption class="g7__caption">
		Пресс сжимает тело между столом на большом поршне и верхней плитой: поршни сдвигаются ровно настолько, насколько поддаётся тело. Рисунок в масштабе, кроме стрелок сил; ходы малого поршня ускорены.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
	.prl2 .g7__svg {
		max-width: 34rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}
	.prl2__ctl {
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
		gap: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
	}
	.prl2__pickcol,
	.prl2__sliders {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		align-content: start;
	}
	.prl2__below {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 0.3rem 1.25rem;
		margin-top: 0.8rem;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.prl2__msg {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
	}
	@container (max-width: 36rem) {
		.prl2__below,
		.prl2__ctl {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
	.prl2__oil {
		fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ig-v) 40%, transparent);
	}
	.prl2__wall {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 2.4;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}
	.prl2__pipe {
		fill: none;
		stroke: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ig-v) 45%, var(--sl-color-gray-4));
		stroke-width: 6;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}
	.prl2__flow {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--sl-color-white);
		stroke-width: 1.6;
		stroke-dasharray: 3 6;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		opacity: 0;
	}
	.prl2__flow.is-on {
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.prl2__seat {
		fill: var(--g7-ink);
	}
	.prl2__ball {
		fill: var(--g7-steel-dark);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.prl2__ball.is-open {
		fill: var(--g7-green);
	}
	.prl2__tap {
		fill: var(--g7-steel);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1.2;
	}
	.prl2__tapbar {
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 3;
		stroke-linecap: round;
	}
	.prl2__tap.is-open {
		fill: var(--g7-green);
	}
	.prl2__frame,
	.prl2__col {
		fill: var(--g7-steel-dark);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1.2;
	}
	.prl2__nut {
		fill: var(--g7-steel);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.prl2__piston,
	.prl2__table {
		fill: var(--g7-steel);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1.2;
	}
	.prl2__ram,
	.prl2__rod {
		fill: var(--g7-steel-dark);
		stroke: var(--g7-ink);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.prl2__handle {
		fill: var(--g7-ink);
	}
